{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43273","headline":"闰月定四时 · 徐至","name":"闰月定四时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积数归成闰，羲和职旧司。\n分铢标斗建，盈缩正人时。\n节候潜相应，星辰自合期。\n寸阴宁越度，长历信无欺。\n定向铜壶辨，还从玉律推。\n高明终不谬，委监本无私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}